  "notes": "The My Profile update!\nNew: My Profile, its own page: your name, characters, achievements, deck stats and everything you wear.\nNew: dice and coin designs in the Shop, alongside sleeves, profile pictures and Tokens.\nNew: characters keep their own picture, sleeve, title, deck, notes and win-loss record. Switch with one click, or Duel as them.\nNew: 16 achievements to earn, and deck stats showing your win rate with each deck and your most played cards.\nNew: wishlist cards are marked in the Shop, and the sidebar tells you when one is in stock.\nNew: Undo and Redo buttons in solo duels (Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y).\nNew: turn banners by name, direct hits that land, a pulsing LP bar when you're low, and a refreshed Shop and Card of the Day.\nNew: Settings > Visual > Reduce motion, and size settings that apply without restarting.\nChanged: Super Rares are now green so they stand apart from Ultra Rares; Constellation Rares are no longer sold in the Shop.\nFixed: duels run much smoother, and the Field Spell background no longer drifts unless you turn it on.",
